<title>USA: Action Products Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Action Products Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>OCALA, Fla. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly Financial Highlights  Year End Financial Highlights</p>
<p>	  For the three months ended	  For the years ended</p>
<p>	 December 31, 1996 and 1995   December 31, 1996 and 1995</p>
<p>Operations	 1996	    1995	   1996	    1995</p>
<p>Sales	  $937,606    $1,086,515   $5,574,746    $5,487,015</p>
<p>Net Income*  (612,876)	(85,165)    (317,855)	149,878</p>
<p>Net Income per share</p>
<p>(primary)*    $(0.40)	 $(0.06)	$(0.21)	   $0.12</p>
<p>Weighted Avg. Shares (primary):</p>
<p>	     1,549,926     1,499,926    1,524,926     1,421,000</p>
<p>Note: *1996 information includes $491,662 ($0.32 per share) of Special Charges associated with the discontinuation of distribution activities and a write down of fixed and other assets.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Action Products International Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
